NV_PK(23,{"you need pineapple to make clay pot duck":"","mullet roe is the eggs of a fish":"","mullet roe is dried in the sun":"","mullets come to taiwan in summer":"","you need radish to make grilled mullet roe":"","you need mugwort to make grilled mullet roe":"","grilled mullet roe is salted sun dried fish roe sliced and eaten with white radish":"","clay pot duck is a whole duck stewed for hours with very soft chinese cabbage":"","four herb soup is a light pork soup cooked with four kinds of chinese herbs":"","they come in winter around the winter solstice":"","it stews for about three hours":"","it is a salty soup with pork":"","a long running taiwanese restaurant in tainan its clay pot duck has been the signature for sixty years chinese cabbage is cooked very soft in pork bone broth then a whole duck goes in with garlic dried flatfish and fried shallots and stews for about three hours it is still cooked in an iron pot over charcoal and the soup is sweet and fragrant":"","red crab sticky rice is a classic dish at taiwanese banquets weddings and new year's eve dinners a whole orange red crab sits on top of steamed sticky rice and it looks festive it also has a lucky meaning the crab full of roe stands for wealth and a good harvest and the sticky rice stands for a family that stays together and has many children that is why it is often the last big dish of a banquet":""});